  if (ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) {
    ws.close()
  }
}
```

**When This Triggers**:
- User closes dialog
- User navigates away
- Component removed from DOM
- Parent component re-renders without this child

### Mechanism 3: Error Handler
